WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The simulated humanoid maintains hand contact with the suspended yellow box above the rectangular target platform.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
As the box descends, the humanoid adjusts its arms and posture while guiding the load closer to the platform.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The box remains over the target while the humanoid guides it with its hands. This is a continuation of the same HOIST simulation shown in the task overview.
